  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Make the Queue Interactive\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Find the buttons in `script.js`:\r\n   - `completeOldestButton`\r\n   - `removeNewestButton`\r\n2. When **Complete Oldest** is clicked:\r\n   - Remove the first item from the `pickups` array.\r\n   - Call `renderPickups()`.\r\n3. When **Remove Newest** is clicked:\r\n   - Remove the last item from the `pickups` array.\r\n   - Call `renderPickups()`.\r\n\r\n### Check Your Code:\r\n- Does clicking **Complete Oldest** remove the first pickup?\r\n- Does clicking **Remove Newest** remove the last pickup?\r\n- Does the list update after each click?\r\n- Where are you calling `renderPickups()`?",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
